  {
   "section": "3",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Thank You for an Impressive Linde Automation Summit 2025!"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "What an incredible two days at our Linde Experience Hub in Aschaffenburg! We were thrilled to welcome international automation experts, forward-thinking customers, leading press members, and intralogistics multipliers/consultants to the Linde Automation Summit 2025."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Together, we explored insightful industry talks, showcased our comprehensive solution portfolio, and provided a firsthand experience of the future of intralogistics with our latest AI-driven processes."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Ready to optimize your operations? The conversation doesn't end here. If you're ready to discuss specific solutions for your business, contact our experts today."
    }
   ],
