  {
   "section": "8",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": ": Attendees witnessed live demonstrations of our advanced automated solutions, showcasing their efficiency and precision."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Linde Automated Solutions in Action"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": ": The event featured a deep dive into the future of warehousing with Linde Material Handling and NVIDIA."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "AI Insights"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": ": We were proud to offer a first look at the new automated Linde counterbalance truck and share more innovations to come."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Next-Gen Tech"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": ": Live demos provided key insights into our scalable, easy-to-use automation software."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Software Solutions"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": ": Sessions covered the latest trends in automation and featured best practices from our valued customers."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Expert Talks & Success Stories"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 10,
     "text": ": The summit served as a key forum for automation and intralogistics experts to connect with their peers and share ideas."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "Networking"
    }
   ],
