  {
   "section": "13",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Our lineup of industry experts shared firsthand knowledge from the front lines of intralogistics, detailing what works, what doesn’t, and how to apply proven solutions to today's operational challenges."
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 0,
   "editableTexts": 1,
   "repeats": []
  },
  {
   "section": "14",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "is a Founder, Consultant and Speaker."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Dr. Oliver Zuchowski"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "As Head of Intralogistics Automation at Bosch, he leads the global strategy for mobile robotics. Leveraging over 10 years of experience, he helps companies successfully realize their automation plans."
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 1,
   "editableTexts": 2,
   "repeats": [
    {
     "unitSelector": "P.",
     "count": 2,
     "unit": {
      "headings": 0,
      "ctas": 0,
      "imgs": 0,
      "textRuns": 1
     },
     "uniform": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "section": "15",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "has been shaping industrial automation for years, from DB Schenker to Bosch."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Matthias Koblitz"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "As Senior Automation Consultant and Product Owner at Bosch, he helps plants worldwide unlock the value of mobile robotics, from technology selection to ROI-driven rollouts and sustainable scaling."
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 1,
   "editableTexts": 2,
   "repeats": [
    {
     "unitSelector": "P.",
     "count": 2,
     "unit": {
      "headings": 0,
      "ctas": 0,
      "imgs": 0,
      "textRuns": 1
     },
     "uniform": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "section": "16",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "From a strategic logistician in the Royal Netherlands Army to managing international supply chains at Herbalife,"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Hendrik van Duuren – ROSSMANN"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "and ultimately to the pinnacle of retail logistics: Today, as Head of Logistics for Dirk Rossmann GmbH, Hendrik van Duuren oversees one of the most demanding logistics operations in the German retail industry."
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 1,
   "editableTexts": 2,
   "repeats": [
    {
     "unitSelector": "P.",
     "count": 2,
     "unit": {
      "headings": 0,
      "ctas": 0,
      "imgs": 0,
      "textRuns": 1
     },
     "uniform": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "section": "17",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "With a Master's degree in Production and Logistics Management, Luca drives innovative projects at ROSSMANN."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Luca Borg – ROSSMANN"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "He most recently managed the logistics for the permanent display, which won the ECR Award last year. He is now the project lead for the major innovative project, RoCaP."
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 1,
   "editableTexts": 2,
   "repeats": [
    {
     "unitSelector": "P.",
     "count": 2,
     "unit": {
      "headings": 0,
      "ctas": 0,
      "imgs": 0,
      "textRuns": 1
     },
     "uniform": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "section": "18",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "As Director Supply Chain Management Industrial Technology at ZF Friedrichshafen AG, Matthias Baier drives strategic development and efficient global supply chain solutions."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Matthias Baier"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "With a rich career trajectory at ZF, including leadership roles in logistics and supply chain design, he leverages extensive expertise to enhance competitive advantages and strengthen supply chain resilience in industrial technology."
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 1,
   "editableTexts": 2,
   "repeats": [
    {
     "unitSelector": "P.",
     "count": 2,
     "unit": {
      "headings": 0,
      "ctas": 0,
      "imgs": 0,
      "textRuns": 1
     },
     "uniform": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "section": "19",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "is Executive Vice President Global Operations at SCHUNK SE & Co. KG, where he oversees the entire process from order fulfillment to customer delivery."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Tobias Arndt"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "With over 20 years of experience in logistics and supply chain management, he possesses comprehensive expertise and a deep understanding of the demands of modern supply chains."
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 1,
   "editableTexts": 2,
   "repeats": [
