   "section": "22",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": ", Vice President and Co-Lead of the Automation Business Unit of Linde Material Handling, brings over 25 years of extensive experience in supply chain solutions and international sales. A seasoned expert in developing sales structures and driving change management, Frank specializes in international sales and realization of holistic and integrated automated warehouse solutions."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Frank Heptner"
    }
   ],
